      "spam": false,
      "value": "Yeah, this would be great. Ideally, it would be held in some sorta avatar metadata component with fields for things like date created, creator, and other tags for things such as categories. For example \"Human\", \"Anime\", \"Naruto\"\"Boy\" etc. Also it would be great if you could search avatars by those fields.",
