  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-03-08T06:27:47.318Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I believe that there should be a feature to have somewhere in the avatar menu to have the original creator's name somewhere by the equipped avatar, I believe this would help out greatly since most of the times I want to find out who created the avatar and contact them.",
